---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="About | Virtual Concept Technologies"
  description="Learn about Virtual Concept Technologies and Enyinnaya Omeruah, a technology and cybersecurity specialist working across cybersecurity, networking, AI, and technical education."
>
  <main>

    <!-- INTRODUCTION -->
    <section class="bg-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-8 lg:py-32">
        <div class="max-w-4xl">

          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-600">
            VCT / About
          </p>

          <h1 class="mt-6 text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-6xl">
            Virtual Concept Technologies
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-xl font-semibold leading-8 text-slate-700">
            Practical technology for a more secure and connected digital world.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
            Virtual Concept Technologies brings together technology,
            cybersecurity, artificial intelligence, and technical education
            to create practical digital solutions for individuals,
            organizations, and communities.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
            The work of VCT is grounded in a simple idea: technology should
            not only be innovative, but useful, secure, understandable, and
            accessible to the people who depend on it.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- THE PERSON BEHIND THE WORK -->
    <section class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">

        <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.5fr] lg:items-start">

          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-600">
              The person behind the work
            </p>

            <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-4">
              <img
                src="/enyinnaya-omeruah.png"
                alt="Enyinnaya Omeruah"
                width="56"
                height="56"
                class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover"
              />

              <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
                Enyinnaya Omeruah
              </h2>
            </div>

            <p class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-700">
              Technology & Cybersecurity Specialist
            </p>

            <div class="mt-7">
              <a
                href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/enyinnaya-omeruah"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex rounded-lg bg-slate-950 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-slate-800"
              >
                View LinkedIn Profile
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
            <p>
              Enyinnaya Omeruah is a technology and cybersecurity professional
              whose work has developed across network engineering,
              cybersecurity, artificial intelligence, technical education,
              and digital technology.
            </p>

            <p>
              His experience began with practical work in networking and
              technical support and grew through years of working with network
              infrastructure, Linux systems, cybersecurity, and technical
              training.
            </p>

            <p>
              Along the way, working directly with students, professionals,
              organizations, and technology environments shaped a practical
              approach to solving technology problems: understand the real
              need, build with purpose, and make security part of the solution
              from the beginning.
            </p>

            <p>
              That experience informs the work at Virtual Concept Technologies,
              where technology, cybersecurity, AI, and education come together
              to address real-world digital challenges.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- THE JOURNEY -->
    <section class="bg-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">

        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-600">
            The journey
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
            From networks and systems to cybersecurity and AI.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 max-w-4xl space-y-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">

          <p>
            A foundation in computer networking and infrastructure provided
            the starting point. Working with routers, firewalls, VPNs, DNS,
            DHCP, Linux systems, and network troubleshooting created a strong
            understanding of how the underlying technology that connects
            people and organizations actually works.
          </p>

          <p>
            Technical education became another important part of that journey.
            Through years of teaching and mentoring, complex technical subjects
            had to be translated into practical knowledge that students and
            professionals could understand and apply.
          </p>

          <p>
            Cybersecurity naturally became a central part of this work.
            Network security, security awareness, vulnerability assessment,
            security operations, and practical cybersecurity training brought
            together the infrastructure experience and the educational
            approach.
          </p>

          <p>
            More recently, artificial intelligence and emerging digital
            technologies have expanded the possibilities. They provide new
            ways to build useful tools, automate work, improve learning, and
            create technology that can respond to real operational needs.
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- VCT -->
    <section class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">

        <div class="max-w-4xl">

          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-600">
            Virtual Concept Technologies
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
            Turning practical experience into useful technology.
          </h2>

          <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
            <p>
              Virtual Concept Technologies reflects the intersection of
              Enyinnaya's experience in technology, cybersecurity, AI,
              networking, and technical education.
            </p>

            <p>
              The company focuses on building digital solutions, helping
              organizations strengthen their technology and cybersecurity
              capabilities, and making technical knowledge more practical and
              accessible.
            </p>

            <p>
              Rather than treating technology as an end in itself, VCT focuses
              on solving useful problems. That means building carefully,
              securing what matters, and enabling people with the knowledge and
              tools they need to work confidently in a digital environment.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- PROFESSIONAL FOCUS -->
    <section class="bg-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">

        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-600">
            Professional focus
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
            Where experience meets the work.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600">01</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Cybersecurity
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
              Security awareness, cybersecurity fundamentals, vulnerability
              assessment, network security, and practical security education.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600">02</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Networking
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
              Network infrastructure, routing, firewalls, VPNs, DNS, DHCP,
              troubleshooting, and secure network operations.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600">03</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              AI & Technology
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
              AI-assisted solutions, automation, digital products, emerging
              technologies, and practical technology-driven problem solving.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600">04</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Technical Education
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
              Hands-on instruction, technical mentoring, practical labs, and
              training across networking, Linux, cybersecurity, and IT.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- CLOSING -->
    <section class="bg-slate-950">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">

        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-400">
            A practical approach
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
            Build useful. Secure what matters. Enable people.
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
            This is the approach behind Virtual Concept Technologies:
            combining technical depth with practical thinking to create
            technology that works in the real world.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8">
            <a
              href="/contact/"
              class="inline-flex rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-blue-500"
            >
              Start a Project
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</MainLayout>
